    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/f8a4f65b29f6ed6d8bbb0b2bd011c666.avif?t=1741803572\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump &amp; Hook has a simple concept, use your hook to climb up.  <br>use your momentum and swing upwards, use the environment to twist your rope, there are endless ways to climb higher.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump &amp; Hook </strong>is a precision platformer 2d singleplayer game, in which you control a tiny robot with a grappling hook, use your grappling hook to latch into the objects and swing by bouncing off the environment or by moving side to side and sling yourself upwards!   <br>    <br>but you must be mindful as you decide when to release the hook - if you fail to get where you want to be, you'll fall down, there are no check points but if you are fast you can save yourself by hooking into objects on the way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your objective is to get to the top, the demo features 5 different stages that you need to pass through to prove that you've truly mastered the art of the grappling hook, each screen introduces new problems that you need to solve to progress, such as using objects to wrap the rope around, latching only from the top and more!    <br>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game offers the freedom to decide how to get upwards, find the optimal path and keep improving your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.poster.avif?t=1741803572\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.webm?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.mp4?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.poster.avif?t=1741803572\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.webm?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.mp4?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/f8a4f65b29f6ed6d8bbb0b2bd011c666.avif?t=1741803572\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump &amp; Hook has a simple concept, use your hook to climb up.  <br>use your momentum and swing upwards, use the environment to twist your rope, there are endless ways to climb higher.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump &amp; Hook </strong>is a precision platformer 2d singleplayer game, in which you control a tiny robot with a grappling hook, use your grappling hook to latch into the objects and swing by bouncing off the environment or by moving side to side and sling yourself upwards!   <br>    <br>but you must be mindful as you decide when to release the hook - if you fail to get where you want to be, you'll fall down, there are no check points but if you are fast you can save yourself by hooking into objects on the way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your objective is to get to the top, the demo features 5 different stages that you need to pass through to prove that you've truly mastered the art of the grappling hook, each screen introduces new problems that you need to solve to progress, such as using objects to wrap the rope around, latching only from the top and more!    <br>   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game offers the freedom to decide how to get upwards, find the optimal path and keep improving your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.poster.avif?t=1741803572\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.webm?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/32c249debba64adc45d9f338d03b5d99.mp4?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.poster.avif?t=1741803572\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.webm?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337780/extras/fdc895b95f005f71529c8a8d49f92eca.mp4?t=1741803572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
